Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:20.79,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:28.38,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:22.03,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:25.08,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:31.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:36.46,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:41.97,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:46.68,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:51.51,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:56.89,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:21:01.74,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:07.22,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:12.16,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:17.61,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:22.68,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:27.89,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.78,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Saionji...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:56.41,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Go get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:59.20,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.12,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, if I fall asleep now, I'll never finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:05.28,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.95,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get a breath of fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.84,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:12.91,Main Dialog,Assistant A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:13.92,Main Dialog,Assistant B,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.68,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You guys should take a break when you get the chance as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:20.97,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Call my cell if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:26.48,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,We should have just enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.23,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:03:59.87,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.63,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.01,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're like ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.92,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You must have been freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:17.68,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well if I turn off the AC, the boys will sweat on the manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:20.60,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,The cool air helps with stress too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.06,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:36.28,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,About that new offer you were talking about the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:42.12,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's worth it if your current work's quality will drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:48.83,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ma, your body probably won't be able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.55,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you're making a decent living as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.22,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to be greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:53.92,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:55.22,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:05:00.31,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I may be popular now, but who knows what the future holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:05.14,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There are always new, younger artists appearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:11.11,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I could be dropped just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:15.28,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ma, you worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:17.24,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,It's unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:21.54,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You have ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:22.66,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.43,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Tch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:30.05,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ma, you're a girl, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:35.05,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:36.85,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a comic artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:40.93,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:47.52,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for making a scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:51.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:55.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Going to work is such a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:01.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I called you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:09.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. It was just so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Does that cool you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:13.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:18.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna make your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:19.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:35.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.99,0:06:38.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.99,0:06:42.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer vacation has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In the morning, we make her lunch together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:47.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and then Rin goes to a day-care center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:52.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna visit Grandpa's grave next Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time for the Bon Festival, and it's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? Don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:03.22,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers haven't bloomed yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It looks they need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:11.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, let's buy flowers at a florist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:14.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We can go again when your flowers bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:23.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa will be happy to see the bellflowers you grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:26.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right? That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:32.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But what would make Grandpa happiest is if you visited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:36.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.01,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:51.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If Rin weren't here, I probably wouldn't be thinking of Grandpa like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.65,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:57.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:01.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you move, it screws the whole thing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Whoopsie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why is your hair so fine anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:07.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:21.97,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:28.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:32.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:36.36,Caption Top,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\pos(24,15)}O-Bon Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.65,0:08:39.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ten or so, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.07,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.32,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:50.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This brings back memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.75,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a bunch of 'em in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.80,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:06.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:15.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here lots of times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:17.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,With Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:17.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:22.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see. You know, I think Grandma's laid to rest here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:31.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Grandpa and Grandma's daughter is my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:34.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:37.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother is Grandpa's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:43.46,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Then that makes me your mother's sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:47.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! I don't want her to think about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:49.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:53.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:59.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The grave's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:10.49,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako had it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:16.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:26.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell? She didn't even bother coming to his funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:30.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:37.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just pull up the weeds for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She comes with another man to visit the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bark! Bark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:31.42,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:33.83,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were some freak...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm supposed to be visiting a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Emphasis on the "supposed to be"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you might want to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:45.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At Grandpa's grave...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:53.47,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:03.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Rin's important to me, so honestly, I don't think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:06.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nor do I give a damn about your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:11.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Unless Rin asks, I have no intention of ever getting you two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.74,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:18.87,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,So then why did you go out of your way to follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:24.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to at least take a peek at Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:30.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to clean the grave off, light incense, and go home like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:32.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It'll take some time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:36.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Rin's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:43.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're just gonna go about our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was I gone long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:15.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I had to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:20.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.51,0:13:21.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:22.73,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:24.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.16,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:37.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:40.54,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.56,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's no longer a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:58.43,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Blood ties are an amazing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:14:00.98,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. She looks just like you, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.94,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,From behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:05.98,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:09.61,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,From this far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.78,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,He's a lot like Souichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:22.70,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.16,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:30.47,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe a coincidence like this happened because it's nearly Bon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:34.59,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's seven years old today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.48,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.18,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I was surprised about your daughter, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.60,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,but I thought that man was your ex...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:42.56,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:47.53,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that man has a single brain cell in that skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:58.71,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Although I can't say what he'll be like given another half a century...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:02.25,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Half... a century?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:08.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that man was her boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:14.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not my place to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But some people...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:20.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She sure found herself a sweetheart fast enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:22.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:26.72,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's near here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:34.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not Grandpa's house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is somebody living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:41.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No. No one's living there, but the house is my uncle's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:45.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My mom's older brother's house, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:47.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The family altar is there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:51.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:59.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I'll ask my uncle if we can just go in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:00.73,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Only the yard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:03.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:05.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:16.69,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to try that assignment after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:18.25,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.03,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about this, Ma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:24.49,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alone for the sake of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:26.58,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.00,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're already working plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:30.66,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You work enough for two people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.08,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:37.43,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to work so hard I forget what I had for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:41.67,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on. I always forget what I had for dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:42.80,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:45.72,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.39,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:56.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:22.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you've totally changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:42.19,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:43.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:45.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The dirt's gone too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:49.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers were precious to Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:54.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't mean to remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:18:00.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle knows Grandpa's favorite flower at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:03.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But they wither when winter comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:08.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he didn't know that they put out buds again in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:12.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The rocks, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:15.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't spread them all over like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:18.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,weeds will spring up and become tough to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:26.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thankfully, we moved Rin's fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Saved its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:36.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good thing we have Grandpa's bellflowers at our house too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:41.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because of that, they're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:44.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:52.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe change isn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:57.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that grave will always be Grandpa's grave, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:58.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:08.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:14.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a chocolate cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:25.50,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Saionji, can you do the final check?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.34,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:31.90,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You really might be in over your head this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:36.72,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When you say it like that, my hand stops working, so cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:49.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:58.45,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.65,0:21:52.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the festival stalls are gonna close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.07,0:21:53.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, they won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds just like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:03.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:08.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're supposed to meet up at the shrine, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:12.63,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom's taking too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:14.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:16.80,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump in that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.60,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Was that awesome or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:22.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:24.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'd leave after she was dressed, and to meet at the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.15,0:22:33.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:35.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Before the festival stalls close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:43.66,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:44.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:47.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! It's hard to run in wooden sandals!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.21,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.21,0:22:50.63,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You can carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:51.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
